  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "社會事業與永續經營管理數位學習(一)",
    "sub_ename": "SOCIAL ENTERPRISE AND SUSTAINABLE MANAGEMENT E-LEARNING(1)",
    "describe_ch": "課程旨在提供學生掌握現代社會事業與永續發展的管理專業，並結合數位工具與平台，促進自主學習。學生透過數位平台修課，探索社會創新、企業社會責任（CSR）、永續經營策略等領域，培養在數位化環境中實踐社會價值的能力。",
    "describe_eh": "The course aims to equip students with the management expertise necessary for modern social enterprises and sustainable development, while integrating digital tools and platforms to promote self-directed learning. Through digital platforms, students will explore areas such as social innovation, corporate social responsibility (CSR), and sustainable business strategies, developing the ability to practice social value in a digital environment.",
